   development throughout the world. East African countries have shown an
   incredible development in energy sector by increasing production which
   has raised significantly energy consumption since last decade. Rwanda's
   energy policy has planned to reach the level of 563 MW electricity
   production by 2018 which will fulfil the population's demand by 70\% and
   decrease the dependence on fuel wood from 86.3\% to 50\%. The paper in
