   Paul Y; Architecture Design \& Res Grp Ltd (AD+RG); China State
   Construct (CSCEC); Sino Grp; Vantage Int (Holdings) Ltd; ASCE Hong Kong
   Sect; ASHRAE Hong Kong Chapter; CIBSE; Construct Ind Council (CIC);
   Chartered Inst Bldg (CIOB); Council Sustainable Dev; Emerald; Hong Kong
   Inst Architects; Hong Kong Institut Engineers; Hong Kong Inst Surveyors;
   HKSTS; IUE; JSCE; RICS; Urban Planning Soc China; China Civil Engn Soc},
Abstract = {Nowadays manual production techniques in small-scaled precast concrete
   companies still dominates concrete prefabrication in Switzerland. New
   concepts and strategies are required to empower the small-scaled precast
   concrete companies as well as local construction companies, architects
   and engineers to benefit from industrialisation concepts like mass
   customisation for the client's value creating process. This paper
   focuses on the cooperative development and production network as one
   dimension in a two-dimensional cooperative business model. The
   cooperative development and production network will enable Swiss precast
   concrete (SPC) companies to increase their automation level and
   implement a mass customisation approach on a platform basis. It ensures
   a flexible and economical provision of individual elements in order to
   improve the competitiveness of the small-scaled SPC companies in the
   European market environment.},
