   Language \& Design},
Abstract = {Music like any other art helps the individual explore the world,
   develops the individual's emotional sphere, building fundamentals for
   systematisation and classification of phenomena, algorithms of creative
   thinking on the basis of the perception and analysis of music artistic
   characters, thus defining development of students' memory, fantasy and
   imagination, stimulating them to search for unusual solutions of
   problems. The development of these abilities is indispensable in any
   sphere of human activity and - what is the most important - gives a
   possibility for individual's self-realisation. Therefore the main task
   of music education is development of the complete personality, based on
   the needs and demands of the modern society. Solution of this task
   requires reviewing of the music educational process, modernisation of
   the ways of realisation of the educational content, ensuring creation of
   new teaching forms, methods, means and technologies.},
