   Acad Exchange Serv Fdn; TU Bergakademie Freiberg},
Abstract = {Taking Shanghai Chongming as an example, this study attempts to identify
   the level of Nongjiale Ecotourism service quality in China. The SERVQUAL
   mode is applied to measure tourist's satisfaction in Chongming Nongjiale
   Ecotourism. In order to find out the the gap between the customer
   expectations and perceptions, a questionare with 24 questions of 5
   SERVQUAL attributes are distributed to Nongjiale tourists. More detailed
   analyses on facilities and service, which affect customers' choice, are
   delivered by SPSS statistical analysis to explore problems generated by
   the service quality of ascension. In allusion to problems and
   shortcomings impede the nongjiale ecotourism development; the authors
   put forward some feasibility suggestions to improve the service quality
   of Chongming Nongjiale Ecotourism based on promoting industrial
   development of Chongming island ecological industry. This research may
   contribute to provide reference for the sustainable development of rural
   ecotourism in China.},
